senses.gloss:
--offered to Hari in Payovrata.
1: भा. VIII. १६. ४१.
Offered by the merchants of मथुरा to कृष्ण and his brother;
2: Ib. X. ४२. १३.
used by त्रिवक्रा before she met कृष्ण;
3: Ib. X. ४८. 5.
offered to Brahmana ladies, who were not widows, in the Devi temple just before the marriage of रुक्मिणी;
4: Ib. X. ५३. ४८; ६१. 6.
given by कृष्ण to Brahmanas;
5: Ib. X. ७०. १३: ७३. २६.
offered to Kucela by कृष्ण;
6: Ib. X. ८०. २२.
offered to Hari by Indrasena;
7: Ib. X. ८५. ३७; XI. २७. ४३.
to be offered to Tripurasundari during worship.
8: Br. IV. ४३. १३.
